  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Learners Through Transformative Education for Sustainable Development in Asia and the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support two countries in the Asia Pacific which have strong commitment to the ESD for 2030 process, namely Indonesia and Tonga in ESD in formulating and implementing ESD country initiatives, through providing technical support, capacity building, broad-based consultations with diverse stakeholders, and knowledge exchange to address urgent environmental issues, transition to green and digital economies, and enable sustainable development. There is a particular need to support a small number of countries to become &apos;champions&apos; of ESD for 2030, whose high-quality actions can serve as inspiration to others.</narrative>
  </description>
